+<li>The camera connection is set up directly between your browser and the application.
+No STUN or TURN server is used: the server list in <code>ui.py</code> is empty, so this works
+when the browser and the application run on the same computer. If a server is added to that
+list later, this page must name it.</li>
 <li>During installation, <code>download_models.py</code> downloads the MediaPipe model files
 from <code>storage.googleapis.com</code>, and <code>pip</code> downloads packages from PyPI.</li>
 <li>Streamlit usage statistics are switched off in <code>.streamlit/config.toml</code>.</li>
